+        "geometric ratio, and continue the same multiplicative cycle through A; "
+        "without this decomposition one searches dense residue permutations."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: quotient-frequency recovery is an O(n^2 log k) exact algorithm; "
+        "at the provisional hard preset it performs about 37000 modular operations, "
+        "whereas complement decomposition takes at most 234 exact arithmetic "
+        "operations but must be recognized and executed without tools."
