-The paper asks for orderings of subsets of a cyclic group whose partial sums
-are distinct.  This module inverse-generates a sequencing: a hidden geometric
-progression of increments has telescoping partial sums.  The public instance is
-only the unordered residue set; verification independently recomputes partial
-sums and never consults the planted answer.
-"""
